[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4648972788","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120060#issuecomment-4648972788","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120060","id":4648972788,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFRmx9A","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T12:27:52Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T12:27:52Z","body":"The highlighting does not use the configured pairs. It's implemented in `TextEdit` using a hardcoded list of pairs `()`, `[]` and `{}`.\n\nCC @kitbdev you seem to have added the documentation on this using `auto_brace_completion_pairs`. Did that ever work or was it just a wrong assumption?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4648972788/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4651546396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120060#issuecomment-4651546396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120060","id":4651546396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFUD3HA","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T17:18:48Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T17:18:48Z","body":"My bad, I guess I thought it did because `auto_brace_completion_highlight_matching` uses the words `auto_brace_completion` which refers to the configurable pairs. Instead of just `brace_highlight_matching` or something. \nAnd it really should be configurable, it looks like it isn't only because the drawing is in TextEdit which doesn't know about the pairs.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4651546396/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot